{"login": "ShreyaLaxminarayan", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "b3a0f2d003381d8ab5c8b91d424c52e35182c8d2", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nThe goal is to calculate the strike rate for each batsman based on their runs scored and balls faced in multiple matches. The input data is in the form of JSON objects, and the output should provide the name of the batsman along with their local strike rate for each match.\r\n\r\nMapper (mapper.py):\r\n\r\nThe mapper processes the input data in the form of an array of JSON objects, where each object contains information about a batsman's performance in a match.\r\nIt calculates the local strike rate for each match using the formula: (runs/balls) * 100 (rounded to 3 decimal places).\r\nThe output of the mapper is stored in the regular filesystem.\r\nReducer (reducer.py):\r\n\r\nThe reducer receives the output of the mapper, which includes the name of the batsman and their local strike rate for each match.\r\nIt aggregates the local strike rates for each batsman to calculate their final strike rate.\r\nThe reducer outputs independent JSON objects with the name of the batsman and their aggregate strike rate.", "created_at": "2023-10-06T19:00:01Z", "repo": "-Strike-Rate-Calculation-using-MapReduce", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dc543d689b8dbcb6a61b935c67175694d4673da4", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2023-10-06T18:54:06Z", "repo": "-Strike-Rate-Calculation-using-MapReduce", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5ae919e2c27f0321af830ae5ddbbc207234527dd", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2025-03-26T11:24:46Z", "repo": "Movie-Ticket-Booking-System-Using-Python-and-Tkinter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c3c439e49e0aeb2742877e46bcc15d428bda5d8c", "message": "Add files via upload\n\nFeatures:\r\n\r\nLogin: Users can log in with a username and password to access the ticket booking system.\r\n\r\nMovie Selection: Users can choose from a list of available movies.\r\n\r\nTicket Quantity: Users can specify the number of tickets they want to purchase.\r\n\r\nSeat Selection: Users can select seats in a graphical interface, and the selected seats change color to indicate availability.\r\n\r\nConfirmation: Users can confirm their booking or cancel it.\r\n\r\nUser Details: Users can enter their name, phone number, payment method, card number, and password.\r\n\r\nTicket Generation: Upon confirmation, a movie ticket is generated with user details, movie information, and the selected seats.", "created_at": "2023-10-06T19:07:20Z", "repo": "Movie-Ticket-Booking-System-Using-Python-and-Tkinter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "aa5529623103e1844232f51f868171efe1210d22", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2023-10-06T19:02:43Z", "repo": "Movie-Ticket-Booking-System-Using-Python-and-Tkinter", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9982d8de3a05936e666b0dc575b419c66f7dacf5", "message": "first commit", "created_at": "2023-11-26T08:49:52Z", "repo": "Supply-Chain-Management-Project-", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c94ea1fd732d115e24ffcef52d10c82eb580ddbc", "message": "Update hello.cpp", "created_at": "2024-03-09T15:25:42Z", "repo": "PES1UG21CS934_Jenkins", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2c7c804f02256cd4f1e0486bf13df8d128b4bbe1", "message": "Update hello.cpp", "created_at": "2024-03-09T15:20:25Z", "repo": "PES1UG21CS934_Jenkins", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "f5acb44ddb015ac06b504c57d1df65709ebc3e50", "message": "Update Jenkinsfile", "created_at": "2024-03-09T14:53:46Z", "repo": "PES1UG21CS934_Jenkins", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3d9d3f60926de444e5bb29247d4877aa